  - is there API for analytics?
    - resetAnalyticsData() is just for local data.
    - https://firebase.google.com/docs/reference/android/com/google/firebase/analytics/FirebaseAnalytics#(com.google.firebase.analytics.FirebaseAnalytics).setConsent(kotlin.Function1)
    - setAnalyticsCollectionEnabled(true)
    - "If a user withdraws their previously given consent for Analytics or Ad storage, Google Analytics deletes all user properties"
